    "end": 166.682,
    "id": "w104"
  },
  {
    "text": "工厂帮你填安全默认值，",
    "start": 166.682,
    "end": 168.768,
    "id": "w105"
  },
  {
    "text": "哲学是 fail-closed：",
    "start": 168.768,
    "end": 171.802,
    "id": "w106"
  },
  {
    "text": "没声明并发安全，",
    "start": 171.802,
    "end": 173.319,
    "id": "w107"
  },
  {
    "text": "就当不安全；",
    "start": 173.319,
    "end": 174.457,
    "id": "w108"
  },
  {
    "text": "没声明只读，",
    "start": 174.457,
    "end": 175.595,
    "id": "w109"
  },
  {
    "text": "就当可能改世界。",
    "start": 175.595,
    "end": 177.112,
    "id": "w110"
  },
  {
    "text": "类比机场安检：",
