    "start": 238.928,
    "end": 241.673,
    "id": "w148"
  },
  {
    "text": "既瘦身，",
    "start": 241.673,
    "end": 242.458,
    "id": "w149"
  },
  {
    "text": "也少泄架构。",
    "start": 242.458,
    "end": 243.634,
    "id": "w150"
  },
  {
    "text": "工具一多，",
    "start": 243.634,
    "end": 244.614,
    "id": "w151"
  },
  {
    "text": "就上延迟发现 ToolS",
    "start": 244.614,
    "end": 246.967,
    "id": "w152"
  },
  {
    "text": "earchTool。",
    "start": 246.967,
    "end": 248.928,
    "id": "w153"
  },
  {
    "text": "别把整本百科砸到模型脸上；",
    "start": 248.928,
    "end": 251.477,
    "id": "w154"
  },
  {
    "text": "先给目录索引——名字列表。",
    "start": 251.477,
    "end": 254.026,
    "id": "w155"
  },
  {
    "text": "真要用时，",
    "start": 254.026,
    "end": 255.007,
    "id": "w156"
  },
  {
    "text": "再翻开那一页 schema。",
    "start": 255.007,
    "end": 257.752,
    "id": "w157"
  },
  {
    "text": "MCP 一挂几十个工具，",
    "start": 257.912,
    "end": 259.932,
    "id": "w158"
  },
  {
    "text": "全量 schema 能吃",
    "start": 259.932,
    "end": 261.952,
    "id": "w159"
  },
  {
    "text": "掉几千 token；",
    "start": 261.952,
    "end": 263.636,
    "id": "w160"
  },
  {
    "text": "延迟发现省的是初始 pr",
    "start": 263.636,
    "end": 265.656,
    "id": "w161"
  },
  {
    "text": "ompt 的腰围。",
    "start": 265.656,
    "end": 267.171,
    "id": "w162"
  },
  {
    "text": "显式 alwaysLoa",
    "start": 267.171,
    "end": 269.191,
    "id": "w163"
  },
  {
    "text": "d 的不延迟；",
    "start": 269.191,
    "end": 270.369,
    "id": "w164"
  },
  {
    "text": "MCP 默认延迟；",
    "start": 270.369,
    "end": 271.885,
    "id": "w165"
  },
  {
    "text": "搜索工具自己不延迟。",
    "start": 271.885,
    "end": 273.568,
    "id": "w166"
  },
  {
    "text": "从全量到 API，",
    "start": 273.728,
    "end": 275.377,
    "id": "w167"
  },
  {
    "text": "还要过过滤漏斗：",
    "start": 275.377,
    "end": 276.843,
    "id": "w168"
  },
  {
    "text": "模式过滤——简单模式只留",
    "start": 276.843,
    "end": 279.041,
    "id": "w169"
  },
  {
    "text": " Bash、",
    "start": 279.041,
    "end": 280.141,
    "id": "w170"
  },
  {
    "text": "Read、",
    "start": 280.141,
    "end": 281.057,
    "id": "w171"
  },
  {
    "text": "Edit；",
    "start": 281.057,
    "end": 281.973,
    "id": "w172"
  },
  {
    "text": "拒绝规则拿掉 blank",
    "start": 281.973,
    "end": 284.171,
    "id": "w173"
  },
  {
    "text": "et deny；",
    "start": 284.171,
    "end": 285.637,
    "id": "w174"
  },
  {
    "text": "启用状态再筛；",
    "start": 285.637,
    "end": 286.92,
    "id": "w175"
  },
  {
    "text": "最后内建加 MCP 合并、",
    "start": 286.92,
    "end": 289.301,
    "id": "w176"
  },
  {
    "text": "按名排序去重。",
    "start": 289.301,
    "end": 290.584,
    "id": "w177"
  },
  {
    "text": "排序不是洁癖，",
    "start": 290.744,
    "end": 292.018,
    "id": "w178"
  },
  {
    "text": "是为了 prompt 缓",
    "start": 292.018,
    "end": 294.202,
    "id": "w179"
  },
  {
    "text": "存稳定——顺序一抖，",
    "start": 294.202,
    "end": 296.022,
    "id": "w180"
  },
  {
    "text": "缓存就废。",
    "start": 296.022,
    "end": 296.931,
    "id": "w181"
  },
  {
    "text": "过滤是权限的第一道：",
    "start": 296.931,
    "end": 298.751,
    "id": "w182"
  },
  {
    "text": "模型看不见的工具，",
    "start": 298.751,
    "end": 300.389,
    "id": "w183"
  },
  {
    "text": "连「想用」都难。",
    "start": 300.389,
    "end": 301.845,
    "id": "w184"
  },
  {
    "text": "BashTool 是最有",
    "start": 301.845,
    "end": 304.029,
    "id": "w185"
  },
  {
    "text": "力的那只手，",
    "start": 304.029,
    "end": 305.121,
    "id": "w186"
  },
  {
    "text": "也是最需要戴手套的。",
    "start": 305.121,
    "end": 306.941,
    "id": "w187"
  },
  {
    "text": "失败会取消并行的兄弟 B",
    "start": 306.941,
    "end": 309.124,
    "id": "w188"
  },
  {
    "text": "ash——命令链常有隐式",
    "start": 309.124,
    "end": 311.308,
    "id": "w189"
  },
  {
    "text": "依赖，",
    "start": 311.308,
    "end": 311.854,
    "id": "w190"
  },
  {
    "text": "mkdir 挂了后面别装勇敢。",
    "start": 311.854,
    "end": 314.584,
    "id": "w191"
  },
  {
    "text": "中断行为可定制：",
    "start": 314.744,
    "end": 316.456,
    "id": "w192"
  },
  {
    "text": "有的长任务选择阻塞看进度，",
    "start": 316.456,
    "end": 319.238,
    "id": "w193"
  },
  {
    "text": "而不是立刻掐死。",
    "start": 319.238,
    "end": 320.949,
    "id": "w194"
  },
  {
    "text": "它还会做 AST 与语义分析，",
    "start": 320.949,
    "end": 324.159,
    "id": "w195"
  },
  {
    "text": "判断是不是搜索只读，",
    "start": 324.159,
    "end": 326.299,
    "id": "w196"
  },
  {
    "text": "好折叠 UI。",
    "start": 326.299,
    "end": 327.797,
    "id": "w197"
  },
  {
    "text": "沙盒仍是安全网：",
    "start": 327.797,
    "end": 329.508,
    "id": "w198"
  },
  {
    "text": "就算权限 bypass，",
    "start": 329.508,
    "end": 332.076,
    "id": "w199"
  },
  {
    "text": "文件系统边界还能兜。",
    "start": 332.076,
    "end": 334.216,
    "id": "w200"
  },
  {
    "text": "文件三件套像 CRUD，",
    "start": 334.376,
    "end": 336.521,
    "id": "w201"
  },
  {
    "text": "却故意缺 Delete。",
    "start": 336.521,
    "end": 338.667,
    "id": "w202"
  },
  {
    "text": "删是不可逆，",
    "start": 338.667,
    "end": 339.739,
    "id": "w203"
  },
  {
    "text": "通常丢给 Bash 的 rm，",
    "start": 339.739,
    "end": 342.421,
    "id": "w204"
  },
  {
    "text": "触发更严权限。",
    "start": 342.421,
    "end": 343.672,
    "id": "w205"
  },
  {
    "text": "Read 带文件状态缓存，",
    "start": 343.672,
    "end": 345.996,
    "id": "w206"
  },
  {
    "text": "少做重复 I/O。",
    "start": 345.996,
    "end": 347.605,
    "id": "w207"
  },
  {
    "text": "Edit 用 old_s",
    "start": 347.605,
    "end": 349.751,
    "id": "w208"
  },
  {
    "text": "tring 换 new_",
    "start": 349.751,
    "end": 351.896,
    "id": "w209"
  },
  {
    "text": "string，",
    "start": 351.896,
    "end": 353.148,
    "id": "w210"
  },
  {
    "text": "不用行号——行号一偏移就改错地；",
    "start": 353.148,
    "end": 356.008,
    "id": "w211"
  },
  {
    "text": "精确串匹配更幂等。",
    "start": 356.168,
    "end": 357.565,
    "id": "w212"
  },
  {
    "text": "Write 最重，",
    "start": 357.565,
    "end": 358.963,
    "id": "w213"
  },
  {
    "text": "整文件覆盖，",
    "start": 358.963,
    "end": 359.895,
    "id": "w214"
  },
  {
    "text": "权限最严。",
    "start": 359.895,
    "end": 360.671,
    "id": "w215"
  },
  {
    "text": "最佳实践：",
    "start": 360.671,
    "end": 361.447,
    "id": "w216"
  },
  {
    "text": "能 Edit 别 Write，",
    "start": 361.447,
    "end": 363.777,
    "id": "w217"
  },
  {
    "text": "能 Read 别 Bash。",
    "start": 363.777,
    "end": 365.95,
    "id": "w218"
  },
  {
    "text": "Glob 对文件名，",
    "start": 365.95,
    "end": 367.503,
    "id": "w219"
  },
  {
    "text": "Grep 对内容，",
    "start": 367.503,
    "end": 368.901,
    "id": "w220"
  },
  {
    "text": "底层 fast-glob",
    "start": 368.901,
    "end": 370.764,
    "id": "w221"
  },
  {
    "text": " 与 ripgrep。",
    "start": 370.764,
    "end": 372.472,
    "id": "w222"
  },
  {
    "text": "为什么不一律 Bash ",
    "start": 372.632,
    "end": 375.022,
    "id": "w223"
  },
  {
    "text": "find/grep？",
    "start": 375.022,
    "end": 377.014,
    "id": "w224"
  },
  {
    "text": "结构化输出更好解析；",
    "start": 377.014,
    "end": 379.005,
    "id": "w225"
  },
  {
    "text": "默认只读，",
    "start": 379.005,
    "end": 380.001,
    "id": "w226"
  },
  {
    "text": "权限更松；",
    "start": 380.001,
    "end": 380.997,
    "id": "w227"
  },
  {
    "text": "结果上限与并行可针对性优化。",
    "start": 380.997,
    "end": 383.785,
    "id": "w228"
  },
  {
    "text": "专门化打败「万能锤子」。",
    "start": 383.785,
    "end": 386.175,
    "id": "w229"
  },
  {
    "text": "AgentTool 是派副驾：",
    "start": 386.175,
    "end": 389.162,
    "id": "w230"
  },
  {
    "text": "子智能体独立上下文与工具集，",
    "start": 389.162,
    "end": 391.951,
    "id": "w231"
  },
  {
    "text": "干完把结果交回。",
    "start": 391.951,
    "end": 393.544,
    "id": "w232"
  },
  {
    "text": "常 alwaysLoad，",
    "start": 393.704,
    "end": 395.976,
    "id": "w233"
  },
  {
    "text": "别被延迟发现藏起来。",
    "start": 395.976,
    "end": 397.724,
    "id": "w234"
  },
  {
    "text": "createSubage",
    "start": 397.724,
    "end": 399.822,
    "id": "w235"
  },
  {
    "text": "ntContext 继承",
    "start": 399.822,
    "end": 401.92,
    "id": "w236"
  },
  {
    "text": "权限等边界，",
    "start": 401.92,
    "end": 402.968,
    "id": "w237"
  },
  {
    "text": "但不共享消息列表——继承",
    "start": 402.968,
    "end": 405.066,
    "id": "w238"
  },
  {
    "text": "却不串味。",
    "start": 405.066,
    "end": 405.94,
    "id": "w239"
  },
  {
    "text": "细节放到扩展篇；",
    "start": 405.94,
    "end": 407.338,
    "id": "w240"
  },
  {
    "text": "本章先认门：",
    "start": 407.338,
    "end": 408.387,
    "id": "w241"
  },
  {
    "text": "双手里有一只专门「再生一双手」。",
    "start": 408.387,
    "end": 411.184,
    "id": "w242"
  },
  {
    "text": "编排引擎是指挥中心，",
    "start": 411.344,
    "end": 413.548,
    "id": "w243"
  },
  {
    "text": "三角拉扯：",
    "start": 413.548,
    "end": 414.65,
    "id": "w244"
  },
  {
    "text": "并行要快、",
    "start": 414.65,
    "end": 415.752,
    "id": "w245"
  },
  {
    "text": "安全别抢、",
    "start": 415.752,
    "end": 416.853,
    "id": "w246"
  },
  {
    "text": "结果顺序还得跟请求一致。",
    "start": 416.853,
    "end": 419.498,
    "id": "w247"
  },
  {
    "text": "runTools 是异步生成器。",
    "start": 419.498,
    "end": 423.024,
    "id": "w248"
  },
  {
    "text": "策略叫并发分区：",
    "start": 423.024,
    "end": 424.787,
    "id": "w249"
  },
  {
    "text": "按序切批次；",
    "start": 424.787,
    "end": 426.109,
    "id": "w250"
  },
  {
    "text": "连续的并发安全工具捆一批并行；",
    "start": 426.109,
    "end": 429.415,
    "id": "w251"
  },
  {
    "text": "碰到非安全，",
    "start": 429.415,
    "end": 430.737,
    "id": "w252"
  },
  {
    "text": "单独成批串行。",
    "start": 430.737,
    "end": 432.28,
    "id": "w253"
  },
  {
    "text": "例子：",
    "start": 432.44,
    "end": 432.943,
    "id": "w254"
  },
  {
    "text": "Read a、",
    "start": 432.943,
    "end": 434.118,
    "id": "w255"
  },
  {
    "text": "Read b、",
    "start": 434.118,
    "end": 435.293,
    "id": "w256"
  },
  {
    "text": "Bash ls、",
    "start": 435.293,
    "end": 436.636,
    "id": "w257"
  },
  {
    "text": "Read c。",
    "start": 436.636,
    "end": 437.81,
    "id": "w258"
  },
  {
    "text": "前两个并行；",
    "start": 437.81,
    "end": 438.817,
    "id": "w259"
  },
  {
    "text": "Bash 独自；",
    "start": 438.817,
    "end": 440.16,
    "id": "w260"
  },
  {
    "text": "Read c 必须等 B",
    "start": 440.16,
    "end": 442.174,
    "id": "w261"
  },
  {
    "text": "ash 完——Bash ",
    "start": 442.174,
    "end": 444.188,
    "id": "w262"
  },
  {
    "text": "可能改目录改文件，",
    "start": 444.188,
    "end": 445.698,
    "id": "w263"
  },
  {
    "text": "并行读会读到不确定世界。",
    "start": 445.698,
    "end": 447.712,
    "id": "w264"
  },
  {
    "text": "互动一下：",
    "start": 447.872,
    "end": 448.712,
    "id": "w265"
  },
  {
    "text": "Glob、",
    "start": 448.712,
    "end": 449.553,
    "id": "w266"
  },
  {
    "text": "Grep、",
    "start": 449.553,
    "end": 450.393,
    "id": "w267"
  },
  {
    "text": "Bash npm test、",
    "start": 450.393,
    "end": 452.746,
    "id": "w268"
  },
  {
    "text": "Read a、",
    "start": 452.746,
    "end": 453.923,
    "id": "w269"
  },
  {
    "text": "Edit a、",
    "start": 453.923,
    "end": 455.1,
    "id": "w270"
  },
  {
    "text": "Glob json——你",
    "start": 455.1,
    "end": 457.117,
    "id": "w271"
  },
  {
    "text": "会划几批？",
    "start": 457.117,
    "end": 457.957,
    "id": "w272"
  },
  {
    "text": "书稿答案是五批：",
    "start": 457.957,
    "end": 459.302,
    "id": "w273"
  },
  {
    "text": "前两个并行；",
    "start": 459.302,
    "end": 460.31,
    "id": "w274"
  },
  {
    "text": "Bash 串；",
    "start": 460.31,
    "end": 461.487,
    "id": "w275"
  },
  {
    "text": "Read 因前面非安全不能并回；",
    "start": 461.487,
    "end": 464.176,
    "id": "w276"
  },
  {
    "text": "Edit 串；",
    "start": 464.336,
    "end": 465.483,
    "id": "w277"
  },
  {
    "text": "最后 Glob 再开安全批。",
    "start": 465.483,
    "end": 467.778,
    "id": "w278"
  },
  {
    "text": "Edit 和后面的 Gl",
    "start": 467.778,
    "end": 469.744,
    "id": "w279"
  },
  {
    "text": "ob 不能同批，",
    "start": 469.744,
    "end": 471.055,
    "id": "w280"
  },
  {
    "text": "副作用边界要干净。",
    "start": 471.055,
    "end": 472.53,
    "id": "w281"
  },
  {
    "text": "StreamingToo",
    "start": 472.53,
    "end": 474.497,
    "id": "w282"
  },
  {
    "text": "lExecutor 更狠",
    "start": 474.497,
    "end": 476.463,
    "id": "w283"
  },
  {
    "text": "：",
    "start": 476.463,
    "end": 476.627,
    "id": "w284"
  },
  {
    "text": "不等模型整段说完，",
    "start": 476.627,
    "end": 478.102,
    "id": "w285"
  },
  {
    "text": "流式接到 tool_us",
    "start": 478.102,
    "end": 480.069,
    "id": "w286"
  },
  {
    "text": "e 块就开工。",
    "start": 480.069,
    "end": 481.216,
    "id": "w287"
  },
  {
    "text": "五工具各一秒的老算法可能七秒；",
    "start": 481.376,
    "end": 484.051,
    "id": "w288"
  },
  {
    "text": "流式交叠能压到大约三秒量级。",
    "start": 484.051,
    "end": 486.547,
    "id": "w289"
  },
  {
    "text": "每个工具四阶段：",
    "start": 486.547,
    "end": 487.974,
    "id": "w290"
  },
  {
    "text": "queued、",
    "start": 487.974,
    "end": 489.222,
    "id": "w291"
  },
  {
    "text": "executing、",
    "start": 489.222,
    "end": 491.006,
    "id": "w292"
  },
  {
    "text": "completed、",
    "start": 491.006,
    "end": 492.789,
    "id": "w293"
  },
  {
    "text": "yielded。",
    "start": 492.789,
    "end": 494.216,
    "id": "w294"
  },
  {
    "text": "并行可以跑完，",
    "start": 494.216,
    "end": 495.464,
    "id": "w295"
  },
  {
    "text": "yield 仍按请求序—",
    "start": 495.464,
    "end": 497.604,
    "id": "w296"
  },
  {
    "text": "—未完成的非安全会挡住后",
    "start": 497.604,
    "end": 499.744,
    "id": "w297"
  },
  {
    "text": "面的结果出门。",
    "start": 499.744,
    "end": 500.992,
    "id": "w298"
  },
  {
    "text": "Bash 失败取消并行兄弟；",
    "start": 501.152,
    "end": 503.735,
    "id": "w299"
  },
  {
    "text": "普通读搜失败通常不传染。",
    "start": 503.735,
    "end": 505.949,
    "id": "w300"
  },
  {
    "text": "进度消息绕过顺序，",
    "start": 505.949,
    "end": 507.61,
    "id": "w301"
  },
  {
    "text": "立刻 yield，",
    "start": 507.61,
    "end": 509.271,
    "id": "w302"
  },
  {
    "text": "UI 先亮着。",
    "start": 509.271,
    "end": 510.562,
    "id": "w303"
  },
  {
    "text": "模型 fallback 时，",
    "start": 510.562,
    "end": 513.146,
    "id": "w304"
  },
  {
    "text": "待执行与执行中全部标废弃，",
    "start": 513.146,
    "end": 515.544,
    "id": "w305"
  },
  {
    "text": "防旧结果泄漏。",
    "start": 515.544,
    "end": 516.836,
    "id": "w306"
  },
  {
    "text": "取消用层级子控制器，",
    "start": 516.836,
    "end": 518.681,
    "id": "w307"
  },
  {
    "text": "别共用一个 AbortC",
    "start": 518.681,
    "end": 520.895,
    "id": "w308"
  },
  {
    "text": "ontroller 误伤",
    "start": 520.895,
    "end": 523.109,
    "id": "w309"
  },
  {
    "text": "无关工具。",
    "start": 523.109,
    "end": 524.032,
    "id": "w310"
  },
  {
    "text": "这双手，",
    "start": 524.192,
    "end": 524.893,
    "id": "w311"
  },
  {
    "text": "接的是第 02 章心跳的",
    "start": 524.893,
    "end": 526.995,
    "id": "w312"
  },
  {
    "text": "阶段三与阶段四：",
    "start": 526.995,
    "end": 528.396,
    "id": "w313"
  },
  {
    "text": "边流边入队，",
    "start": 528.396,
    "end": 529.447,
    "id": "w314"
  },
  {
    "text": "边跳边干活。",
    "start": 529.447,
    "end": 530.498,
    "id": "w315"
  },
  {
    "text": "练习可以很具体。",
    "start": 530.498,
    "end": 531.899,
    "id": "w316"
  },
  {
    "text": "一，",
    "start": 531.899,
    "end": 532.249,
    "id": "w317"
  },
  {
    "text": "用 buildTool ",
    "start": 532.249,
    "end": 534.351,
    "id": "w318"
  },
  {
    "text": "做只读小工具，",
    "start": 534.351,
    "end": 535.577,
    "id": "w319"
  },
  {
    "text": "想清楚 isConcur",
    "start": 535.577,
    "end": 537.679,
    "id": "w320"
  },
  {
    "text": "rencySafe 标错",
    "start": 537.679,
    "end": 539.781,
    "id": "w321"
  },
  {
    "text": "的两种代价。",
    "start": 539.781,
    "end": 540.832,
    "id": "w322"
  },
  {
    "text": "二，",
    "start": 540.992,
    "end": 541.349,
    "id": "w323"
  },
  {
    "text": "手动画分区。",
    "start": 541.349,
    "end": 542.419,
    "id": "w324"
  },
  {
    "text": "三，",
    "start": 542.419,
    "end": 542.776,
    "id": "w325"
  },
  {
    "text": "对 StreamingT",
    "start": 542.776,
    "end": 544.916,
    "id": "w326"
  },
  {
    "text": "oolExecutor ",
    "start": 544.916,
    "end": 547.057,
    "id": "w327"
  },
  {
    "text": "打四阶段断点，",
    "start": 547.057,
    "end": 548.305,
    "id": "w328"
  },
  {
    "text": "再 Ctrl+C 看取消链。",
    "start": 548.305,
    "end": 550.803,
    "id": "w329"
  },
  {
    "text": "四，",
    "start": 550.803,
    "end": 551.159,
    "id": "w330"
  },
  {
    "text": "有 MCP 时对比延迟发",
    "start": 551.159,
    "end": 553.3,
    "id": "w331"
  },
  {
    "text": "现开关下的 input ",
    "start": 553.3,
    "end": 555.44,
    "id": "w332"
  },
  {
    "text": "token。",
    "start": 555.44,
    "end": 556.511,
    "id": "w333"
  },
  {
    "text": "收五句。",
    "start": 556.511,
    "end": 557.224,
    "id": "w334"
  },
  {
    "text": "一，",
    "start": 557.384,
    "end": 557.726,
    "id": "w335"
  },
  {
    "text": "五要素协议是工具 DNA。",
    "start": 557.726,
    "end": 559.952,
    "id": "w336"
  },
  {
    "text": "二，",
    "start": 559.952,
    "end": 560.295,
    "id": "w337"
  },
  {
    "text": "buildTool 安全默认，",
    "start": 560.295,
    "end": 562.863,
    "id": "w338"
  },
  {
    "text": "fail-closed。",
    "start": 562.863,
    "end": 564.918,
    "id": "w339"
  },
  {
    "text": "三，",
    "start": 564.918,
    "end": 565.26,
    "id": "w340"
  },
  {
    "text": "并发分区用正确标记换速度。",
    "start": 565.26,
    "end": 567.486,
    "id": "w341"
  },
  {
    "text": "四，",
    "start": 567.486,
    "end": 567.828,
    "id": "w342"
  },
  {
    "text": "StreamingToo",
    "start": 567.828,
    "end": 569.883,
    "id": "w343"
  },
  {
    "text": "lExecutor 让双",
    "start": 569.883,
    "end": 571.937,
    "id": "w344"
  },
  {
    "text": "手零等待上手。",
    "start": 571.937,
    "end": 573.136,
    "id": "w345"
  },
  {
    "text": "五，",
    "start": 573.296,
    "end": 573.722,
    "id": "w346"
  },
  {
    "text": "类型契约让加新工具不必改指挥部。",
    "start": 573.722,
    "end": 577.131,
    "id": "w347"
  },
  {
    "text": "下一集第 04 章，",
    "start": 577.131,
    "end": 579.261,
    "id": "w348"
  },
  {
    "text": "权限管线——Agent 的护栏。",
    "start": 579.261,
    "end": 582.67,
    "id": "w349"
  },
  {
    "text": "双手能伸多远，",
    "start": 582.67,
    "end": 584.161,
    "id": "w350"
  },
  {
    "text": "护栏说了算。",
    "start": 584.161,
    "end": 585.44,
    "id": "w351"
  },
  {
    "text": "本系列基于开源书稿。",
    "start": 585.44,
    "end": 587.57,
    "id": "w352"
  },
  {
    "text": "系列名：",
    "start": 587.57,
    "end": 588.422,
    "id": "w353"
  },
  {
    "text": "驭者·Agent Har",
    "start": 588.422,
    "end": 590.979,
    "id": "w354"
  },
  {
    "text": "ness。",
    "start": 590.979,
    "end": 592.044,
    "id": "w355"
  },
  {
    "text": "关注小电讲电路，",
    "start": 592.044,
    "end": 593.748,
    "id": "w356"
  },
  {
    "text": "合集里看目录更新。",
    "start": 593.748,
    "end": 595.666,
    "id": "w357"
  },
  {
    "text": "我们下集见。",
    "start": 595.666,
    "end": 596.944,
    "id": "w358"
  }
]